      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a part in a machine that doesnt even need me. like every day is just more fuel for a system that would replace me in a heartbeat if i stopped moving. there’s nothing left of me that feels real anymore. just a series of tasks and bills. i’m just a cog.",
